finally decided to take the leap of faith and start my own business.<\/p>","text_color":"#FFFFFF","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ab32aea"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"60e9cceb","settings":{"editor":"<p>For 12 years I worked under my father-in-law learning everything I could from his experience and expertise. It was in these years that I came to love the air conditioning trade. After those 12 years, I decided it was time to move into the manufacturing side of the Industry, and for almost 10 years I was employed by the largest HVAC manufacturer in the world, Daikin Comfort Technologies. At Daikin I was able to work with many of the top innovators and leaders in today's HVAC industry, gaining more experience and more focused training in what makes an HVAC system run better and more efficiently, as well as the importance of air quality within a home. In November of 2023, my family and I felt the time was right to open Magnolia Air &amp; Electric and we invite you to be a part of our business by creating lasting relationships through hard work, quality craftsmanship, and a dedication to the best service and equipment we can provide.<\/p>","text_color":"#FFFFFF","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ab32aea"}],"_padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"69810a8c","settings":{"editor":"Ho